%T A399823 3,103,59,311,103,107,3,7,61,13,3,5,433,3,5,29,227,269,13,59,7,179,3,
%U A399823 3,11,13,349,29,101,13,61,31,11,521,19,101,71,229,571,11
%N A399823 For n>=1, a(n) is the least twin prime that starts a block of 2*n - 1 consecutive terms of A077800 having a twin-prime sum.
%e A399823 3 is the first twin-prime in the chain [3, 5, 5], which is the earliest chain of 2 * 2 - 1 = 3 consecutive twin-primes whose sum, 13, is a twin-prime. Hence a(2) = 1.
%e A399823 71 is the first twin-prime in the chain [71, 73, 101, 103, 107, 109, 137, 139, 149, 151, 179, 181, 191, 193, 197], which is the earliest chain of 2 * 8 - 1 = 15 consecutive twin-primes whose sum, 2081, is a twin-prime. Hence a(8) = 15.
%Y A399823 Cf. A001097, A013918, A053845, A070934, A071151, A077800, A400578, A400738.
